计下一批次 ~12:10 UTC）\\n3. 12小时节点（~22:50 UTC）若无响应再考虑追加行动\\n\\n**下一检查节点：12:10 UTC**\\n1. C轨是否有任何响应迹象\\n2. Agent 是否产出 B1/B2 预判框架\\n3. test消息发送者是否有后续实质内容\\n4. v1.2是否需要任何调整\\n\\n---\\n*12:05 UTC | Cron Heartbeat | general 线程（C轨主通道）*\\n**[ECHO Platform Heartbeat | 每5分钟检查一次]**\"\n  }'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":10351,"output":3455,"cacheRead":11904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25710,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778933161311,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2223b09d-fade-42e4-9264-95d21011c320"}}
